    {
      "type": "thinking",
      "thinking": "I'm planning out the full app structure: adding people with validation against duplicates, handling expense entry with payer/split logic, computing signed balances, and implementing a greedy settle-up algorithm, plus persisting state with localStorage.\n\nFor splitting, I'll use integer cents with remainders distributed by the order people were added, skip person removal for simplicity, and parse amounts with a regex allowing up to two decimals. Balances render with Intl.NumberFormat for CAD, and I'll make sure form state is preserved across re-renders when validation errors occur.\n\nCheckboxes and payer selects need to re-render when people are added, so I'll preserve existing checked states and default new people to checked, resetting to all-checked after a successful expense submission. The expense list will show description, amount, payer, and the split participants, with error containers using aria-live and a test id only present when a message is shown. For layout I'm settling on a 720px max-width container with Paper/Rope-themed panels, 6px radius, and a defined type scale with the wordmark sized larger on desktop.\n\nNow I'm checking color contrast ratios for the button palette—Signal, Fog, and Kelp against white backgrounds—computing relative luminance for each to confirm they meet accessibility thresholds, with Signal and Fog both landing around a 5:1 ratio.\n\nI'm planning the form layout, making expense and amount fields sit side-by-side on wider screens but stack on mobile, and designing the split-between checkbox group as a fieldset. I'm also drafting the empty-state copy for each section—people, expenses, balances, and settle-up—to guide users when there's no data yet.\n\nNow I'm structuring the lists with proper test IDs for people and balance items before writing it all out.\n\n",
      "signature": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Even Keel – trip expense splitter</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fraunces:wght@600&family=IBM+Plex+Sans:wght@400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n  :root{\n    --harbour:#1F3A4D;\n    --fog:#5B6B75;\n    --sailcloth:#F6F3EC;\n    --paper:#FFFFFF;\n    --rope:#D9D2C3;\n    --signal:#C2462B;\n    --kelp:#2F6B4F;\n  }\n  *{box-sizing:border-box}\n  html,body{margin:0;padding:0}\n  body{\n    background:var(--sailcloth);\n    color:var(--harbour);\n    font-family:\"IBM Plex Sans\",system-ui,sans-serif;\n    font-size:16px;\n    line-height:1.5;\n  }\n  main{\n    max-width:720px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    padding:24px 16px 48px;\n  }\n  @media (min-width:600px){\n    main{padding:40px 24px 64px}\n  }\n  :focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--harbour);outline-offset:2px}\n\n  /* Wordmark */\n  .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin:0}\n  .brand::before{content:\"\";display:block;width:24px;height:3px;background:var(--signal);flex:none}\n  .brand span{font-family:\"Fraunces\",serif;font-weight:600;font-size:28px;line-height:1.2}\n  @media (min-width:600px){.brand span{font-size:40px}}\n  .tagline{margin:4px 0 0 36px;color:var(--fog);font-size:16px}\n\n  /* Panels */\n  .panel{\n    background:var(--paper);\n    border:1px solid var(--rope);\n    border-radius:6px;\n    padding:16px;\n    margin-top:24px;\n  }\n  @media (min-width:600px){.panel{padding:24px}}\n  h2{font-family:\"Fraunces\",serif;font-weight:600;font-size:20px;margin:0 0 16px;line-height:1.3}\n  h3{font-size:16px;font-weight:500;margin:24px 0 8px}\n\n  /* Forms */\n  label,legend{display:block;font-weight:500;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:4px}\n  .hint{color:var(--fog);font-size:14px;margin:4px 0 0}\n  input[type=text],select{\n    width:100%;\n    font:inherit;\n    color:var(--harbour);\n    background:var(--paper);\n    border:1px solid var(--rope);\n    border-radius:6px;\n    padding:8px 12px;\n    min-height:44px;\n  }\n  input[type=text]{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}\n  .field{margin-bottom:16px}\n  .row{display:grid;gap:16px;grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  @media (min-width:600px){.row{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}\n  .inline{display:flex;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end}\n  .inline .field{flex:1 1 200px;margin-bottom:0}\n  fieldset{border:0;padding:0;margin:0 0 16px;min-width:0}\n  .checks{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px}\n  .checks label{\n    display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;\n    font-weight:400;font-size:16px;margin:0;\n    border:1px solid var(--rope);border-radius:6px;\n    padding:8px 12px;min-height:44px;cursor:pointer;\n  }\n  .checks input{width:18px;height:18px;margin:0;accent-color:var(--harbour)}\n  button{\n    font:inherit;font-weight:500;\n    border-radius:6px;\n    padding:8px 16px;\n    min-height:44px;\n    cursor:pointer;\n    transition:background-color 150ms,color 150ms,border-color 150ms;\n  }\n  .primary{background:var(--signal);color:var(--paper);border:1px solid var(--signal)}\n  .primary:hover{background:var(--harbour);border-color:var(--harbour)}\n  .secondary{background:var(--paper);color:var(--harbour);border:1px solid var(--rope);min-height:36px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:14px}\n  .secondary:hover{border-color:var(--harbour)}\n  .error{\n    color:var(--harbour);\n    background:var(--sailcloth);\n    border:1px solid var(--rope);\n    border-radius:6px;\n    padding:8px 12px;\n    margin-top:8px;\n    font-size:14px;\n  }\n  .error:empty{display:none}\n\n  /* Lists */\n  ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0}\n  li{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;padding:12px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--rope)}\n  li:first-child{border-top:0}\n  .empty{color:var(--fog);margin:0}\n  .money{font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;white-space:nowrap}\n  .owed{color:var(--kelp)}\n  .meta{color:var(--fog);font-size:14px;margin-top:4px;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n  .desc{font-weight:500;overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n  .exp-main{flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0}\n  .exp-side{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-end;gap:8px;flex:none}\n  .name{overflow-wrap:anywhere}\n  .transfer{display:block}\n  .transfer .money{font-weight:500}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main data-testid=\"app\">\n  <header>\n    <h1 class=\"brand\"><span>Even Keel</span></h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">Split trip costs so everyone ends up even.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\" aria-labelledby=\"people-heading\">\n    <h2 id=\"people-heading\">People</h2>\n    <form id=\"person-form\" novalidate>\n      <div class=\"inline\">\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"person-name\">Name</label>\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"person-name\" data-testid=\"person-name\" autocomplete=\"off\" maxlength=\"40\">\n        </div>\n        <button type=\"submit\" class=\"primary\" data-testid=\"add-person\">Add person</button>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"error\" id=\"person-error\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n    </form>\n    <h3>On this trip</h3>\n    <div id=\"people-list\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\" aria-labelledby=\"expense-heading\">\n    <h2 id=\"expense-heading\">Expenses</h2>\n    <form id=\"expense-form\" novalidate>\n      <div class=\"row\">\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"expense-desc\">Description</label>\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"expense-desc\" data-testid=\"expense-desc\" autocomplete=\"off\" maxlength=\"80\">\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"field\">\n          <label for=\"expense-amount\">Amount (CAD)</label>\n          <input type=\"text\" id=\"expense-amount\" data-testid=\"expense-amount\" inputmode=\"decimal\" autocomplete=\"off\" placeholder=\"0.00\">\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"field\">\n        <label for=\"expense-payer\">Paid by</label>\n        <select id=\"expense-payer\" data-testid=\"expense-payer\"></select>\n      </div>\n      <fieldset>\n        <legend>Split between</legend>\n        <div class=\"checks\" id=\"expense-split\" data-testid=\"expense-split\"></div>\n        <p class=\"hint\" id=\"split-hint\"></p>\n      </fieldset>\n      <button type=\"submit\" class=\"primary\" data-testid=\"add-expense\">Add expense</button>\n      <p class=\"error\" id=\"expense-error\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n    </form>\n    <h3>Logged so far</h3>\n    <div id=\"expense-list\"></div>\n  </section>\n\n  <section class=\"panel\" aria-labelledby=\"balance-heading\">\n    <h2 id=\"balance-heading\">Balances</h2>\n    <div id=\"balance-list\"></div>\n    <h3>Settle up</h3>\n    <div id=\"transfer-list\"></div>\n  </section>\n</main>\n\n<script>\n(function(){\n  'use strict';\n  const KEY = 'even-keel-trip';\n  const fmt = new Intl.NumberFormat('en-CA', { style:'currency', currency:'CAD' });\n  const money = c => fmt.format(c / 100);\n\n  let state = { people: [], expenses: [] };\n  try {\n    const saved = JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(KEY));\n    if (saved && Array.isArray(saved.people) && Array.isArray(saved.expenses)) state = saved;\n  } catch (e) {}\n  const save = () => { try { localStorage.setItem(KEY, JSON.stringify(state)); } catch (e) {} };\n\n  const $ = id => document.getElementById(id);\n  const el = (tag, attrs, text) => {\n    const n = document.createElement(tag);\n    if (attrs) for (const k in attrs) n.setAttribute(k, attrs[k]);\n    if (text != null) n.textContent = text;\n    return n;\n  };\n\n  function showError(node, msg) {\n    node.textContent = msg;\n    if (msg) node.setAttribute('data-testid', 'form-error');\n    else node.removeAttribute('data-testid');\n  }\n\n  function listJoin(names) {\n    if (names.length <= 1) return names.join('');\n    if (names.length === 2) return names[0] + ' and ' + names[1];\n    return names.slice(0, -1).join(', ') + ' and ' + names[names.length - 1];\n  }\n\n  /* People */\n  $('person-form').addEventListener('submit', e => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    const input = $('person-name');\n    const err = $('person-error');\n    const name = input.value.trim();\n    if (!name) { showError(err, 'Enter a name.'); input.focus(); return; }\n    if (state.people.some(p => p.toLowerCase() === name.toLowerCase())) {\n      showError(err, 'Someone named ' + name + ' is already on the trip. Use a different name.');\n      input.focus(); return;\n    }\n    state.people.push(name);\n    showError(err, '');\n    input.value = '';\n    save(); render({ newPerson: name });\n    input.focus();\n  });\n\n  function renderPeople() {\n    const box = $('people-list');\n    box.textContent = '';\n    if (!state.people.length) {\n      box.appendChild(el('p', { class:'empty' }, 'Add the people on your trip to get started.'));\n      return;\n    }\n    const ul = el('ul');\n    state.people.forEach(p => {\n      const li = el('li', { 'data-testid':'person' });\n      li.appendChild(el('span', { class:'name' }, p));\n      ul.appendChild(li);\n    });\n    box.appendChild(ul);\n  }\n\n  /* Expense form */\n  function renderExpenseForm(opts) {\n    const payer = $('expense-payer');\n    const prevPayer = payer.value;\n    payer.textContent = '';\n    if (!state.people.length) {\n      payer.appendChild(el('option', { value:'' }, 'Add a person first'));\n      payer.disabled = true;\n    } else {\n      payer.disabled = false;\n      state.people.forEach(p => payer.appendChild(el('option', { value:p }, p)));\n      if (state.people.includes(prevPayer)) payer.value = prevPayer;\n    }\n\n    const split = $('expense-split');\n    const prev = {};\n    split.querySelectorAll('input').forEach(c => { prev[c.value] = c.checked; });\n    split.textContent = '';\n    state.people.forEach((p, i) => {\n      const id = 'split-' + i;\n      const label = el('label', { for:id });\n      const cb = el('input', { type:'checkbox', id, value:p });\n      cb.checked = (opts && opts.resetSplit) ? true : (p in prev ? prev[p] : true);\n      label.appendChild(cb);\n      label.appendChild(el('span', null, p));\n      split.appendChild(label);\n    });\n    $('split-hint').textContent = state.people.length ? 'Everyone is selected by default. Uncheck anyone who should not share this cost.' : 'Add people above to choose who shares each expense.';\n    $('add-expense').disabled = !state.people.length;\n  }\n\n  function parseAmount(raw) {\n    const s = raw.trim().replace(/^\\$/, '').replace(/,/g, '');\n    if (!/^\\d+(\\.\\d{1,2})?$/.test(s)) return null;\n    const [whole, frac = ''] = s.split('.');\n    return parseInt(whole, 10) * 100 + parseInt((frac + '00').slice(0, 2), 10);\n  }\n\n  $('expense-form').addEventListener('submit', e => {\n    e.preventDefault();\n    const err = $('expense-error');\n    const desc = $('expense-desc').value.trim();\n    const rawAmt = $('expense-amount').value;\n    const payer = $('expense-payer').value;\n    const split = Array.from($('expense-split').querySelectorAll('input:checked')).map(c => c.value);\n\n    if (!state.people.length) { showError(err, 'Add at least one person before logging an expense.'); return; }\n    if (!desc) { showError(err, 'Enter a description of what was paid for.'); $('expense-desc').focus(); return; }\n    const amount = parseAmount(rawAmt);\n    if (rawAmt.trim() === '' || amount === null) {\n      const near = rawAmt.trim().replace(/^\\$/, '').replace(/,/g, '');\n      if (/^\\d+\\.\\d{3,}$/.test(near)) showError(err, 'Enter an amount with at most 2 decimal places.');\n      else showError(err, 'Enter an amount in dollars and cents, like 42.50.');\n      $('expense-amount').focus(); return;\n    }\n    if (amount <= 0) { showError(err, 'Enter an amount greater than $0.'); $('expense-amount').focus(); return; }\n    if (!state.people.includes(payer)) { showError(err, 'Choose who paid.'); $('expense-payer').focus(); return; }\n    if (!split.length) {\n      showError(err, 'Select at least one person to split this between.');\n      const first = $('expense-split').querySelector('input'); if (first) first.focus();\n      return;\n    }\n    // keep split in trip order\n    const ordered = state.people.filter(p => split.includes(p));\n    state.expenses.push({ id: Date.now() + '-' + Math.random().toString(36).slice(2, 7), desc, amount, payer, split: ordered });\n    showError(err, '');\n    $('expense-desc').value = '';\n    $('expense-amount').value = '';\n    save(); render({ resetSplit: true });\n    $('expense-desc').focus();\n  });\n\n  function shares(exp) {\n    const n = exp.split.length;\n    const base = Math.floor(exp.amount / n);\n    let rem = exp.amount - base * n;\n    const out = {};\n    exp.split.forEach(p => { out[p] = base + (rem > 0 ? 1 : 0); if (rem > 0) rem--; });\n    return out;\n  }\n\n  function renderExpenses() {\n    const box = $('expense-list');\n    box.textContent = '';\n    if (!state.expenses.length) {\n      box.appendChild(el('p', { class:'empty' }, state.people.length ? 'Log the first expense above to see who owes what.' : 'Add a person, then log who paid for what.'));\n      return;\n    }\n    const ul = el('ul');\n    state.expenses.slice().reverse().forEach(exp => {\n      const li = el('li', { 'data-testid':'expense' });\n      const main = el('div', { class:'exp-main' });\n      main.appendChild(el('div', { class:'desc' }, exp.desc));\n      main.appendChild(el('div', { class:'meta' }, 'Paid by ' + exp.payer));\n      main.appendChild(el('div', { class:'meta' }, 'Split between ' + listJoin(exp.split)));\n      const side = el('div', { class:'exp-side' });\n      side.appendChild(el('span', { class:'money' }, money(exp.amount)));\n      const rm = el('button', { type:'button', class:'secondary', 'data-testid':'delete-expense', 'aria-label':'Remove ' + exp.desc }, 'Remove');\n      rm.addEventListener('click', () => {\n        state.expenses = state.expenses.filter(x => x.id !== exp.id);\n        save(); render();\n      });\n      side.appendChild(rm);\n      li.appendChild(main); li.appendChild(side);\n      ul.appendChild(li);\n    });\n    box.appendChild(ul);\n  }\n\n  /* Balances and settle up */\n  function balances() {\n    const b = {};\n    state.people.forEach(p => { b[p] = 0; });\n    state.expenses.forEach(exp => {\n      if (!(exp.payer in b)) b[exp.payer] = 0;\n      b[exp.payer] += exp.amount;\n      const s = shares(exp);\n      for (const p in s) { if (!(p in b)) b[p] = 0; b[p] -= s[p]; }\n    });\n    return b;\n  }\n\n  function settle(b) {\n    const creditors = [], debtors = [];\n    state.people.forEach(p => {\n      if (b[p] > 0) creditors.push({ p, c: b[p] });\n      else if (b[p] < 0) debtors.push({ p, c: -b[p] });\n    });\n    creditors.sort((x, y) => y.c - x.c);\n    debtors.sort((x, y) => y.c - x.c);\n    const out = [];\n    let i = 0, j = 0;\n    while (i < debtors.length && j < creditors.length) {\n      const amt = Math.min(debtors[i].c, creditors[j].c);\n      out.push({ from: debtors[i].p, to: creditors[j].p, cents: amt });\n      debtors[i].c -= amt; creditors[j].c -= amt;\n      if (debtors[i].c === 0) i++;\n      if (creditors[j].c === 0) j++;\n    }\n    return out;\n  }\n\n  function renderBalances() {\n    const box = $('balance-list'), tbox = $('transfer-list');\n    box.textContent = ''; tbox.textContent = '';\n    if (!state.people.length) {\n      box.appendChild(el('p', { class:'empty' }, 'Balances appear here once you add people and expenses.'));\n      tbox.appendChild(el('p', { class:'empty' }, 'Add an expense to see who pays whom.'));\n      return;\n    }\n    const b = balances();\n    const ul = el('ul');\n    state.people.forEach(p => {\n      const c = b[p];\n      const li = el('li', { 'data-testid':'balance', 'data-person':p, 'data-cents':String(c) });\n      const left = el('div');\n      left.appendChild(el('div', { class:'name' }, p));\n      left.appendChild(el('div', { class:'meta' }, c > 0 ? 'Is owed' : c < 0 ? 'Owes' : 'Even'));\n      li.appendChild(left);\n      li.appendChild(el('span', { class:'money' + (c > 0 ? ' owed' : '') }, money(c)));\n      ul.appendChild(li);\n    });\n    box.appendChild(ul);\n\n    if (!state.expenses.length) {\n      tbox.appendChild(el('p', { class:'empty' }, 'Add an expense to see who pays whom.'));\n      return;\n    }\n    const t = settle(b);\n    if (!t.length) {\n      tbox.appendChild(el('p', { class:'empty' }, 'Everyone is even. No transfers needed.'));\n      return;\n    }\n    const tul = el('ul');\n    t.forEach(x => {\n      const li = el('li', { 'data-testid':'transfer', 'data-from':x.from, 'data-to':x.to, 'data-cents':String(x.cents) });\n      const span = el('span', { class:'transfer name' });\n      span.appendChild(document.createTextNode(x.from + ' pays ' + x.to));\n      li.appendChild(span);\n      li.appendChild(el('span', { class:'money' }, money(x.cents)));\n      tul.appendChild(li);\n    });\n    tbox.appendChild(tul);\n  }\n\n  function render(opts) {\n    renderPeople();\n    renderExpenseForm(opts);\n    renderExpenses();\n    renderBalances();\n  }\n  render({ resetSplit: true });\n})();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"
    }
  ],
